Increases your damage and resistance penetration on sleeping targets by [30%, 36%, 41%, 44%, 46% (TL1-5; MP 100)].  Additionally, every time you slay a sleeping target, a Night Terror will be summoned for [2, 4, 6, 8, 10 (TL1-5)] turns.

The Night Terror's stats will scale with your Mindpower, as will the damage bonus to sleeping targets.
